WEBVTT

00:00:00.860 --> 00:00:03.730
World Domination Journal, by Edogawa Jou.

00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:08.910
I completed formulating a perfect,
flawless plan with nothing left to chance.

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:13.540
As part of its execution, I performed the
summoning ritual for the Nine-headed Dragon.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:14.790
It was...

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.080
It was the time when night switches place with day

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:19.790
and I switch places with her.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:23.040
My name is Awashiwa-sama,

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:29.300
another personality that, when Edogawa Jou's spirit is resting, takes control of her body.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:33.050
I was one of the gods she consumed some time ago.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:36.850
I have a body that sprouts a penis from time to time!

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:39.560
<i>Damn.</i>

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:41.150
<i>I should've come up with
something better than—</i>

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:42.650
It does that?

00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:43.820
<i>She bought it?!</i>

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.150
Yes, it's just how my body is!

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:49.150
It only comes out sometimes
and quickly returns to normal!

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:52.320
Then you're still a girl, right, Edogawa-san?

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:53.240
Yes.

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.580
Please keep this a secret from everyone else.

00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:56.830
A-All right.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:00:59.370
It's a secret just between the two of us.

00:00:59.910 --> 00:01:02.250
Yeah. Thanks.

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:03.500
But...

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.750
that's not something contagious, is it?

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:07.260
Huh?

00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:09.880
I won't start growing one like you, will I?

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.760
You don't have to worry about that!

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:17.640
Looks like I managed to fool her.

00:01:17.640 --> 00:01:20.640
I think you messed up big time.

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:23.730
You were watching, Tamamo-no-Mae?

00:01:23.730 --> 00:01:27.730
Given the way you speak, I must still be talking to Ojou-sama's male side.

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:29.610
It's almost time for us to switch, but yeah.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.860
Jou's better at rituals.

00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:32.860
Too right!

00:01:33.240 --> 00:01:35.700
It's dawn now, Awashiwa-sama!

00:01:37.540 --> 00:01:39.580
Gosh, what have you done?!

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.580
Sasami-san almost found out!

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.120
I couldn't have stopped that.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.130
I'm going to perform the ritual.

00:01:45.130 --> 00:01:46.130
Wing General Garuda!

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:53.380
Garuda, be on standby in case of an emergency.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:56.680
Tamamo-no-Mae, put up a barrier and clear people from the area.

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:58.930
Understood, ma'am.

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:03.650
Now, the evil occult society Arahabaki will direct all of its resources

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:06.110
into commencing the world domination operation.

00:02:06.110 --> 00:02:08.980
It's all for the sake of my happiness.

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:12.360
That is to say, it's to satisfy my selfish desires!

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:51.090
"Then... can I call you 'Jou-chan'?" she says.

00:03:52.090 --> 00:03:56.090
<i>At that moment, I unwittingly
formed some small expectations.</i>

00:04:00.890 --> 00:04:02.260
Kagami-nee...

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.770
I'll invite you to join my organization.

00:04:04.770 --> 00:04:08.560
You can become my subordinate
and use your powers to serve me!

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:10.810
Kagami-nee!

00:04:12.570 --> 00:04:14.440
Hey, what's wrong?

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.900
Like, Kagami-nee has...

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:17.990
Kagami-nee!

00:04:17.990 --> 00:04:20.530
What's going on exactly? Tell me!

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.990
You're going to be my servant, aren't you?

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.660
I'm really sorry, Edogawa-san!

00:04:29.420 --> 00:04:31.210
I need to go!

00:04:31.210 --> 00:04:32.790
I'll call you later!

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:35.550
Wait! Hold on, Sasami-san!

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.470
Fine, be that way!

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:41.430
I don't care whether you come back!

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.140
<i>Indeed,</i>

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.770
<i>expectations only exist to be betrayed.</i>

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:54.400
<i>Especially when you're dealing with humans.</i>

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:11.710
<i>I was kind of looking forward to
walking around the festival with you.</i>

00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:17.090
Why don't they ever act
the way I want them to?!

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:18.720
This is why I hate humans!

00:05:18.720 --> 00:05:20.220
I don't understand them!

00:05:20.510 --> 00:05:22.430
It's meaningless to form relationships with others!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:23.510
I don't get them at all!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:27.430
Ojou-sama, all preparations for the operation are complete.

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.640
Got it.

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:29.930
This is my destiny.

00:05:29.930 --> 00:05:33.440
I will accept it and push forward with an indomitable spirit,

00:05:33.940 --> 00:05:35.690
even if that means I'll end up alone.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:39.940
Evil occult society Arahabaki!

00:05:40.490 --> 00:05:41.450
Launch all-out attack!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.030
Take that!

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.240
We must run!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:46.870
I knocked down that guy!

00:05:46.870 --> 00:05:47.910
Does that mean we can take him home?

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:50.370
We already have Meat-chan!

00:05:50.370 --> 00:05:51.660
We can't keep any more pets!

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:53.790
Could we ask Mamarin to keep him?

00:05:58.210 --> 00:06:00.170
Tama, wait here.

00:06:00.170 --> 00:06:01.670
I'll be back soon.

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:02.760
What's wrong?

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.680
It's probably nothing to worry about, but just in case...

00:06:06.470 --> 00:06:08.310
You're going to go get that guy?

00:06:08.310 --> 00:06:10.060
I don't think it's that.

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:25.030
What?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.660
What's going on?!

00:06:32.370 --> 00:06:34.120
Mamarin, help me—

00:06:35.170 --> 00:06:36.170
Tama, Tama!

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:42.220
<i>They must've... drugged her.</i>

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:44.680
<i>It's affecting... me too...</i>

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:48.640
This one was struck by lightning too.

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:53.390
Shrine gates, forest surrounding the
local shrine, statues of guardian deities,

00:06:53.390 --> 00:06:55.940
huge trees, and oddly shaped rocks...

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:58.400
Every spiritual hotspot has been destroyed!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:01.280
I can't stop thinking about the guys
who were in our chat earlier, either.

00:07:01.280 --> 00:07:03.650
This is going to be hell to deal with.

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:06.530
What's the matter, Tsurugi-sensei?

00:07:06.530 --> 00:07:07.700
A barrier!

00:07:07.700 --> 00:07:10.120
We're trapped on this island!

00:07:10.490 --> 00:07:10.990
Wait.

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:12.750
What are you doing?

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:15.120
It's high tide now.

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:17.710
I ain't no child!

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:20.590
Well, not that I want to get my yukata wet.

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:26.010
The plan was to get you alone and
press you to reveal your true identity,

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:28.010
but whatever.

00:07:28.430 --> 00:07:31.760
Let's stay like this a little longer. Okay, Onii-chan?

00:07:40.980 --> 00:07:44.990
It's been quite some time since we
last met, Flame Emperor Kagutsuchi!

00:07:45.990 --> 00:07:47.240
Oh, excuse me.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.410
You're now known as Yagami Kagami.

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.990
My sister did say that she had seen you,

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:54.790
but it still surprises me to see you alive.

00:07:54.790 --> 00:07:57.170
Wing General Garuda is also in fine health.

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:58.630
Aren't you glad?

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:00.170
You used to be one of us.

00:08:00.710 --> 00:08:02.670
So it still exists, doesn't it?

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:04.550
The evil occult society...

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:06.720
Arahabaki!

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.610
In my right hand I hold Iwasaku's sword,

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:24.940
and in my left I hold Nesaku's sword.

00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:29.660
They're the deified forms of the swords that tore Flame Emperor Kagutsuchi apart!

00:08:30.490 --> 00:08:32.490
Unconventional Indian style,

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:34.290
strategic Chinese style,

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:36.250
ritual-based Japanese style...

00:08:36.250 --> 00:08:37.500
Which would you like me to use?

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:41.500
The most beautiful girl of the world's three nations will cut you to pieces!

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:16.910
Morning, Tama-chan.

00:09:16.910 --> 00:09:18.330
Edogawa-san...

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.080
Where's Mamarin?!

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:21.330
Mamarin!

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:23.000
Mamarin isn't answering!

00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:26.500
This island has been completely
sealed off from the world by a barrier.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.880
It's impossible to create a link with Tsukuyomi Sasami, who's in the town of Ame-no-Nuboko.

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:34.640
These people... What are they doing?

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:36.510
It's the backstage festival.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.350
I need your cooperation.

00:09:42.150 --> 00:09:45.150
This shrine's secret ritual recreates the extermination of the Nine-headed Dragon.

00:09:45.480 --> 00:09:49.400
You'll play the hero who has come to put down the evil dragon.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.620
A new god defeats an ancient god.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.410
Don't you think the role fits you well?

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:58.330
You're a god of the next generation, Yagami Tama.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:03.290
I'm an ancient god who has long been forgotten,

00:10:03.750 --> 00:10:06.090
Arahabaki of the Insubmissive Tribes.

00:10:11.010 --> 00:10:13.380
So I'm perfect for the role of the Nine-headed Dragon, aren't I?

00:10:26.270 --> 00:10:30.610
Now, kill me with that sword.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:32.860
No way!

00:10:37.120 --> 00:10:37.870
Come on.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:38.910
Kill me.

00:10:38.910 --> 00:10:39.910
No way!

00:10:40.830 --> 00:10:41.910
You can't do it?

00:10:42.410 --> 00:10:43.670
But that's...

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:45.170
a bad thing...

00:10:46.420 --> 00:10:48.920
to do.

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:52.090
It really helps that you're so kind and foolish.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.470
This ritual is a recreation of the past.

00:10:57.470 --> 00:11:01.350
Meaning, what happens here will
now be what happened in the past.

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:05.140
With Tamamo-no-Mae's powers,
we can make the world believe it.

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:08.860
History will be Transformed to one where the Nine-headed Dragon

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:10.230
defeated the Yamato Imperial Court!

00:11:12.940 --> 00:11:14.990
Does it hurt? Does it?

00:11:14.990 --> 00:11:16.450
Does it hurt even though you're a god?

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.830
Why are you doing this?!

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:21.200
You're Mamarin's friend!

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:27.290
The monotheistic god Arahabaki reigns as the only truly complete deity, the only almighty entity.

00:11:27.290 --> 00:11:29.960
I won't need family, friends, or subordinates.

00:11:29.960 --> 00:11:31.630
I won't need anybody.

00:11:40.510 --> 00:11:41.600
The ritual has been completed!

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:45.020
History will be Transformed, and
the Nine-headed Dragon will be victorious!

00:11:45.020 --> 00:11:46.600
As we lie at the end of that history,

00:11:47.230 --> 00:11:49.860
the Nine-headed Dragon shall now recover its true form!

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.610
The history under Shinto deities will be invalidated!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:55.610
The mythology of Shinto deities will be obliterated!

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:58.620
It's all for the sake of my happiness.

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:02.370
That is to say, it's to satisfy my selfish desires!

00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:25.640
Tama! Tama!

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:29.060
Mamarin, you're back!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.360
What happened, Tama?!

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:33.610
This island was ruined.

00:12:34.030 --> 00:12:37.610
You see, I got eaten.

00:12:37.950 --> 00:12:41.370
A really scary god destroyed everything!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.490
Don't cry, Tama.

00:12:43.490 --> 00:12:45.120
Anyhow, we've got to do something.

00:12:45.120 --> 00:12:47.080
I can't do anything!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:49.920
I got completely eaten!

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.500
Don't give up, Tama!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.590
Please!

00:12:52.590 --> 00:12:54.130
There should be something you can still—

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:55.630
Precisely.

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:58.630
We still have use for you.

00:12:59.010 --> 00:13:00.130
You are...

00:13:03.890 --> 00:13:05.890
the one who plays with scales, Tamamo-no-Mae!

00:13:05.890 --> 00:13:09.350
You're late, Tsukuyomi Sasami.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:13.820
I left an open window in the barrier waiting for you to come online.

00:13:13.820 --> 00:13:15.190
What on earth did you do?!

00:13:15.190 --> 00:13:18.490
As you can see, we revived an
ancient god, the Nine-headed Dragon,

00:13:18.490 --> 00:13:19.900
and destroyed the island.

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:24.700
Using the Nine-headed Dragon's enormous powers as a weapon,

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:27.290
we'll declare war on the world.

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.040
That's just...

00:13:28.040 --> 00:13:30.710
You should be honored, Tsukuyomi Sasami.

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:36.210
Thinking highly of you, my master designated you as the shrine maiden of the new world,

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:39.590
that is to say, the ruler of humanity.

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:40.590
What?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:44.300
An invasion has failed if it annihilates the enemy in the process.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.470
Humans are valuable resources.

00:13:46.890 --> 00:13:52.230
To make good use of them, we need a middle-man between gods and humans: a shrine maiden.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:53.730
Don't listen to her!

00:13:53.730 --> 00:13:56.520
Those people are evil.

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.320
They're just trying to trick you.

00:13:58.320 --> 00:14:00.570
We're offering you concessions here.

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:02.990
If we unleash the energy of the Nine-headed Dragon,

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:07.200
we can vaporize your current location,
the town of Ame-no-Nuboko, in an instant.

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:09.830
Can I trust you?

00:14:09.830 --> 00:14:11.210
Of course you can.

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.710
We have lost.

00:14:13.710 --> 00:14:18.300
We couldn't stop you and dragged
many innocent people into the mess.

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:20.970
There's no point carrying on the fight to the point where everything's destroyed.

00:14:20.970 --> 00:14:24.090
So, if it's me you want...

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:24.970
Mamarin!

00:14:24.970 --> 00:14:27.600
Then take an oath now!

00:14:27.600 --> 00:14:29.350
Swear to God:

00:14:29.350 --> 00:14:34.350
"I, Tsukuyomi Sasami, will become Arahabaki's shrine maiden."

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:35.100
To God?

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:37.230
Oaths made to God are absolute.

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.690
You won't be able to break your word.

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:42.740
We'll trust you only when you do that.

00:14:42.740 --> 00:14:44.240
Mamarin, don't do it!

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:46.070
It's okay, Tama.

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.240
It's okay.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:48.240
That's...

00:14:48.240 --> 00:14:49.990
Because I already...

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.750
bought enough time!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.170
What is happening?

00:14:55.170 --> 00:14:57.840
You let your guard down, Tamamo-no-Mae!

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:59.090
That isn't possible!

00:14:59.090 --> 00:15:01.260
I'm sure I eliminated you!

00:15:01.260 --> 00:15:04.720
Those swords are my natural enemy, after all.

00:15:04.720 --> 00:15:07.390
Determining that I had no chance of winning, I feigned death.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.140
Y-You played possum?

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:11.390
You outwitted me, a fox?!

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:14.890
I am a divine spirit residing in a robotic vessel.

00:15:14.890 --> 00:15:19.230
If that body is wrecked, I just need to abandon it and find a new one.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.900
And you chose this Killing Stone golem?!

00:15:22.190 --> 00:15:23.650
Sorry, everyone.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:26.530
I've been hiding something from all of you.

00:15:27.030 --> 00:15:28.160
Mamarin...

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:32.410
I wanted to join the trip as soon as my cold was gone.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:37.290
So I transported my entire
house inside Tama's body,

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:39.380
letting me come to the island with you.

00:15:39.380 --> 00:15:43.420
I was using this house as a driver's seat, manipulating Tama from inside.

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:47.430
Then, you've been inside the barrier around the island all along?!

00:15:47.430 --> 00:15:50.640
Because of the medication, our senses were disconnected for a time,

00:15:51.390 --> 00:15:55.100
but I even came out and took a bath in the hot springs with Edogawa-san.

00:15:55.640 --> 00:15:59.150
You made a mistake when you believed you had eliminated the three sisters

00:15:59.150 --> 00:16:02.610
and created an opening in the barrier to communicate with me, thinking I was outside.

00:16:02.610 --> 00:16:06.860
By now, Tsurugi should be outside the barrier and working on a counterattack.

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:08.280
She was still alive?!

00:16:08.280 --> 00:16:09.410
This is bad!

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:10.740
I must report this to Ojou-sama!

00:16:10.740 --> 00:16:12.740
Did you think I'd let you get away?

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:14.330
I'll burn you away!

00:16:14.330 --> 00:16:16.120
I, the Flame Emperor Kagutsuchi!

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:25.760
And with that, I have become the owner of this body.

00:16:39.230 --> 00:16:40.360
Are you okay, Tama?

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:42.270
Kagami-nee...

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:44.820
Kagami-nee!

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:45.780
Wait, Tama.

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:46.990
Ow!

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:50.620
It's too early to breath a sigh of relief.

00:16:50.620 --> 00:16:52.990
First off, we should do something about this alternative reality.

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:55.160
I'll use the Great Sacred Mirror!

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:55.790
Huh?

00:16:55.790 --> 00:16:58.710
Tama, you protect yourself.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:01.500
Human world,

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:03.250
return to the way you should be!

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:16.020
Ow...

00:17:20.770 --> 00:17:23.770
This was a desert island!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:26.360
It looked like the world was destroyed.

00:17:26.360 --> 00:17:28.110
Was it an illusion?

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:32.280
It appears the Nine-headed Dragon
didn't revive completely for some reason.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:36.410
If that was just an illusion,
everyone might be alive and well.

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.540
Edogawa-san too.

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:40.290
Look, it's Nee-san.

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:43.040
I can't believe this!

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:46.460
I only came by to check 'cause
something funny was going on.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:49.840
Why've I gotta do this boring shit?

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.340
'Cause if you had sealed
the netherworld properly,

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:55.100
the Nine-headed Dragon
would never have been revived!

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:57.600
Hey...

00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:01.690
In Japan, islands are equivalent to gods, right?

00:18:01.690 --> 00:18:02.440
Yes.

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:04.440
Gods can be islands,

00:18:04.440 --> 00:18:06.360
and islands can be gods.

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:08.360
Then that must mean

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:10.110
this island is...

00:18:15.200 --> 00:18:16.740
It's the Nine-headed Dragon.

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:34.430
I haven't seen something this huge
since the Great Eight-forked Serpent!

00:18:43.850 --> 00:18:47.110
Deliver divine punishment,
Slash of Heavenly Wings!

00:18:50.280 --> 00:18:51.780
Are you retarded?!

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:53.780
Hold back a little, ya stupid idiot!

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:55.410
Our girls are on the island, y'know?

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.500
I'm sorry...

00:19:47.210 --> 00:19:50.170
for not walking around the festival with you.

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:53.010
I'm not bothered by something like that.

00:19:54.090 --> 00:19:54.970
I'm sorry.

00:19:56.260 --> 00:19:58.470
I suddenly got scared.

00:19:58.850 --> 00:19:59.970
Scared?

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:03.730
When I obtain everything and become the
almighty being that rules over the whole world,

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:11.860
I'll never be able to enjoy chatting, laughing, or eating together as we did during this trip.

00:20:11.860 --> 00:20:15.360
I was sure I accepted the fact that I'd be all alone

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:17.490
and even wished to be, but I just couldn't.

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:18.990
I know what you mean.

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:20.490
It's scary to be alone.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:23.240
You don't know anything about me!

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.040
Since childhood, I've worked hard

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:31.460
to meet the great expectations everyone has for the leader of the organization.

00:20:31.460 --> 00:20:34.010
I've worked so, so hard.

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:35.260
Yet...

00:20:36.760 --> 00:20:38.010
You're right.

00:20:38.010 --> 00:20:39.550
Maybe I don't know anything about you.

00:20:42.970 --> 00:20:45.560
But you can have it easy if you run away.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.440
Someday, I'm...

00:20:49.560 --> 00:20:50.690
going to kill you.

00:20:51.110 --> 00:20:54.610
Then until that day comes, we can be friends.

00:20:54.610 --> 00:20:55.940
You're weird.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:58.200
You're so stubborn, Jou-chan.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:04.160
I'm going to sleep until
the rescue party gets here.

00:21:04.160 --> 00:21:06.450
I feel exhausted.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:08.460
Yeah, me too.

00:21:10.170 --> 00:21:12.630
I smell Sasami-san from afar!

00:21:12.630 --> 00:21:13.960
Seriously?

00:21:13.960 --> 00:21:16.340
Now that I'm out of my spiritual power,

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:18.340
we only have your nose to depend on.

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:20.340
Paparin, full speed ahead!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:23.600
Sasami-san, we're coming for you now!

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:27.850
Even for such a hopeless situation,

00:21:27.850 --> 00:21:31.100
you have fallen unbelievably low.

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:33.860
Ruza has become far too corrupt for me to tolerate.

00:21:33.860 --> 00:21:35.940
I have no excuses to give.

00:21:35.940 --> 00:21:40.700
For you to neglect your duties and indulge in an undisciplined life...

00:21:40.700 --> 00:21:42.200
How foolish!

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.620
I will correct your behavior.

00:21:44.620 --> 00:21:46.120
I understand.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:47.580
But I must say...

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:51.000
you're cute when you get jealous!

00:22:02.340 --> 00:22:06.560
We're done working hard for the day.
